s comprise words, similarly, cells are defined by genes", "evidence_for_generative_model": "scGPT, a generative pre-trained transformer", "boundary_case": "clear_include", "decision_rationale": "The abstract explicitly describes scGPT as a generative pre-trained transformer foundation model for single-cell biology, providing clear evidence of a generative architecture and foundation-model characteristics."}, "round-A_architecture_reviewer_paper_type": "primary_model_paper", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_generative_model_present": "yes", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_foundation_model_evidence": "yes", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_primary_exclusion_code": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_uncertainty_reason": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_component": "not_assessed", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_bio_bridge": "Drawing parallels between linguistic constructs and cellular biology — where texts comprise words, similarly, cells are defined by genes", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_generative_model": "scGPT, a generative pre-trained transformer", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_boundary_case": "clear_include", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_decision_rationale": "The abstract explicitly describes scGPT as a generative pre-trained transformer foundation model for single-cell biology, providing clear evidence of a generative architecture and foundation-model characteristics.", "pilot_roundA_scope_gate": "EXCLUDE", "pilot_roundA_architecture_gate": "PASS", "pilot_needs_adjudication": false}
