nd is fine-tuned for prediction tasks, but it does not mention any decoder, autoregressive, sequence-to-sequence, diffusion, or other generative mechanism."}, "round-A_architecture_reviewer_paper_type": "primary_model_paper", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_generative_model_present": "no", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_foundation_model_evidence": "yes", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_primary_exclusion_code": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_uncertainty_reason": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_component": "not_assessed", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_text_bio_bridge": "not_assessed", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_evidence_for_generative_model": "none", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_boundary_case": "clear_exclude", "round-A_architecture_reviewer_decision_rationale": "The abstract presents HViLM as a foundation model for viral genomics that learns from sequences and is fine-tuned for prediction tasks, but it does not mention any decoder, autoregressive, sequence-to-sequence, diffusion, or other generative mechanism.", "pilot_roundA_scope_gate": "UNCERTAIN", "pilot_roundA_architecture_gate": "EXCLUDE", "pilot_needs_adjudication": true, "round-B_adjudicator_output": {"paper_type": "primary_model_paper", "bio_modality_present": "yes", "text_component_present": "no", "text_bio_bridge_present": "no", "generative_model_present": "no", "foundation_model_evidence": "yes", "primary_exclusion_code": "EC2_no_text_component", "uncertainty_reason": "none", "evidence_for_text_component": "none", "evidence_for_text_bio_bridge": "none", "evidence_for_generative_model": "none", "boundary_case": "text_component_boundary", "decision_rationale": "Title asserts a foundation model for viral genomics, but the abstract lacks any mention of natural language text, text-bio alignment, or generative architecture, so the paper fails the text component criterion."}, "round-B_adjudicator_paper_type": "primary_model_paper", "round-B_adjudicator_bio_modal