t is not a substantive text modality.","evidence_snippet":"\"integrates the nucleic-acid language model GENA-LM\" and \"all-token representation strategy\"."},{"record_id":"rec_003488","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"Primary cross-modal analysis linking mutation-selection profiles to histopathology. It uses bio data and image features, but no text/language component is described.","evidence_snippet":"\"cross-modal analysis\" between \"somatic mutations\" and \"H&E-stained whole slide images\"."}]}

